contentText:
Turns out not everyone is excited for the upcoming Pussycat Dolls reunion.

Earlier this month, the iconic girl group announced that they will be reuniting for a 53-date tour across the U.K., Europe and North America. Alongside the tour announcement, the Pussycat Dolls also released a new single, “ Club Song .&#8221;

